# Important Wireshark Filters

## ICMP

```text
icmp
```

Shows ping traffic.

---

## DNS

```text
dns
```

Shows DNS queries and responses.

---

## HTTP

```text
http
```

Shows web traffic.

---

## TCP

```text
tcp
```

Shows TCP packets.

---

## UDP

```text
udp
```

Shows UDP packets.

---

## SIP

```text
sip
```

Shows SIP signaling traffic.

---

## RTP

```text
rtp
```

Shows RTP voice streams.

---

## Specific Port

```text
tcp.port == 80
```

Shows HTTP traffic.

```text
tcp.port == 443
```

Shows HTTPS traffic.

```text
udp.port == 5060
```

Shows SIP traffic.

